        "quote": "Unless otherwise defined in this chapter, the terms used in this chapter shall have the same meaning and definitions as defined in K.S.A. Chapter 41 and amendments thereto. As used in this chapter:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.15.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
